{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23769","headline":"自题新昌居止因招杨郎中小饮 · 白居易","name":"自题新昌居止因招杨郎中小饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地偏坊远巷仍斜，最近东头是白家。\n宿雨长齐邻舍柳，晴光照出夹城花。\n春风小榼三升酒，寒食深炉一椀茶。\n能到南园同醉否，笙歌随分有些些。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}